  "mechanism": "do_sys_writev and do_sys_readv call FileLike::write or FileLike::read once per iovec, and the socket FileLike adapter turns each call into one sendmsg or recvmsg, so one vectored call becomes several datagrams or consumes one datagram per iovec.",
